//! Typefaces of the Noctua design system, embedded: the faces that ship whole, which are the Latin faces, the code face, the symbols and the other scripts.
//!
//! `noctua-design-dist` carries `dist/fonts.css`, which declares every
//! face and asks for each at `../assets/fonts/<file>`: beside the directory
//! that holds `dist/`. This crate is the files it asks for. Cargo cannot
//! package a file above the package directory, and the faces are above
//! every package, so they are copied here byte for byte.
//!
//! ```no_run
//! // build.rs, beside `noctua_design_dist::write_to("static/dist")`
//! fn main() -> std::io::Result<()> {
//!     noctua_design_fonts::write_to("static/assets/fonts")
//! }
//! ```
//!
//! A host that serves from memory serves each entry of [`FILES`] at
//! [`SERVED`]`/<name>` and has no directory at all.
//!
//! The faces keep their own terms, and this library's are not theirs:
//! [`LICENCES`] holds the text that covers every family here, and the
//! record of what was vendored. `write_to` writes them beside the faces,
//! because the SIL Open Font License requires its text to travel with
//! the fonts.

